{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229890-who-s-the-most-poisonous-of-em-all","id":1229890,"title":"Who's the most poisonous of 'em all?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-24T17:41:18-07:00","id":1229890,"title":"Who's the most poisonous of 'em all?","content":"I'm not a big fan of poison and poison mechanics, but recently I've been trying to come up with a combination of charms, evocations, spells, or whatever to create the most effective poison based Dragon Blooded character. However, I thought it would be wise to ask for some advice from the community.<br /> <br /> Can you enlighten this humble seeker of poisonous knowledge please?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-24T17:53:42-07:00","id":1229893,"title":"","content":"I think Spring Razor could do with an Evocation &quot;branching&quot; off of Root-and-Hand Merging that allows the sword to suck poison from your body through the roots, so that you can deliver it unto your enemies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T11:51:38-07:00","id":1230068,"title":"","content":"If you can find a way to use Spring Razor with Black Claw and White Veil, I think you\u2019ll be well on your way. Alternately, there\u2019s a DB thrown charm that lets you reflexively poison a throwing weapon and the Wood version of Elemental Bolt has a poison effect attached to it, so either of those could be tossed out and then you could use the two MA styles to make it much, much worse.<br /> <br /> Finding/Creating a Lore/Occult/Craft charm that let you get easy access to Yozi Venom (or creating a custom demon you can summon and then milk for poison) would be useful too.<br /> <br /> If you want to go full on with a Grey Clawed Veil build, some kind of Green Jade hand jewelry that can sprout a subtle poisoned claw might be a good custom Artifact to get, using Spring Razor as a basis.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s everything I can think of off hand, but there\u2019s probably more somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T12:11:22-07:00","id":1230078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229890-who-s-the-most-poisonous-of-em-all?p=1230068#post1230068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(or creating a custom demon you can summon and then milk for poison)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not Yozi venom, but that's exactly what the teakettle courier is for.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T22:22:04-07:00","id":1230197,"title":"","content":"When you get to Signature Charms, don't overlook Shadow-Stalking Predator Spirit in Stealth. If you're in Wood Aura, it adds (Essence/2, rounded down) to the duration of a poison you deliver with an Unexpected attack from plant-based concealment, along with a lot of other benefits. And for more fun, while nothing about it is directly poison-related, Stalking Apex Predator Technique in Survival is compatible with Shadow-Stalking Predator Spirit and gives you even more benefits while attempting stealth in plant-based concealment.<br /> <br /> What's that? Your game isn't set in a jungle and you're worried you wouldn't get to use plant-based concealment all that often? Arms of the Chosen has Midnight Thorn, a stealth-amid-plants-themed chain shirt which can grow its own bushes for cover, and which further synergizes with the overall Wood-Stealth build.<br /> <br /> You too can become <a href=\"https://consequenceofsound.files.wordpress.com/2017/08/the-tick-hedge.jpg?quality=80&amp;w=806&amp;h=397\" target=\"_blank\">a ninja hedge</a>!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T12:34:09-07:00","id":1230347,"title":"","content":"Jump to 0:47:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Hxnv9pfmH6o?t=47s\" data-code=\"Hxnv9pfmH6o\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Hxnv9pfmH6o/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:36:21-07:00","id":1230894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ascension</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229890-who-s-the-most-poisonous-of-em-all?p=1230197#post1230197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you get to Signature Charms, don't overlook Shadow-Stalking Predator Spirit in Stealth. If you're in Wood Aura, it adds (Essence/2, rounded down) to the duration of a poison you deliver with an Unexpected attack from plant-based concealment, along with a lot of other benefits. And for more fun, while nothing about it is directly poison-related, Stalking Apex Predator Technique in Survival is compatible with Shadow-Stalking Predator Spirit and gives you even more benefits while attempting stealth in plant-based concealment.<br /> <br /> What's that? Your game isn't set in a jungle and you're worried you wouldn't get to use plant-based concealment all that often? Arms of the Chosen has Midnight Thorn, a stealth-amid-plants-themed chain shirt which can grow its own bushes for cover, and which further synergizes with the overall Wood-Stealth build.<br /> <br /> You too can become <a href=\"https://consequenceofsound.files.wordpress.com/2017/08/the-tick-hedge.jpg?quality=80&amp;w=806&amp;h=397\" target=\"_blank\">a ninja hedge</a>!</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;What's this I hear about an intruder in the palace?!&quot;<br /> &quot;False alarm, Your Eminence. The patrol thought they heard someone in your dining room, but it was just some hedges rustling in the wind.&quot;<br /> &quot;Hedges rustling in the wind?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes, Your Eminence.&quot;<br /> &quot;...<i>inside</i> my dining room?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes, Your Eminence.&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh, well <i>that's</i> a relief, then. Carry on!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T00:44:52-07:00","id":1231042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229890-who-s-the-most-poisonous-of-em-all?p=1230068#post1230068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you can find a way to use Spring Razor with Black Claw ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Easy. Unlock the evocations for Spring Razor, and then gift it to your lover. Then steal it from your lover in battle and it becomes a Black Claw weapon.<br /> <br /> That aside, Snake Style deals in Essence poisoning, rather than Iocaine powder. It's capstone charm <i>Essence Venom Strike</i> has what you're looking for, but a few charms before that are &quot;hit them in the chakra and they get soul-poisoned&quot;.<br /> <br /> Also, in 2e I killed someone by tampering with her Maiden's Tea. turns out dosage makes the poison, and taking a 10x dose is pretty dangerous. Also, she wasn't intentionally drinking Maiden's Tea, but turned her death from &quot;murder&quot; to &quot;shameful accident&quot; which pretty quickly hushed any follow up investigation. Assassinations, think outside the box.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}